Fires a special shot based on your currently loaded ammo:

Incendiary - Fire a shot that deals [94%, 113%, 127%, 139%, 150% (TL1-5)] weapon damage as fire and covers targets in radius [1, 1, 2, 2, 2 (TL1-5)] in sticky pitch for [3, 4, 4, 5, 5 (TL1-5)] turns, reducing global speed by [7%, 13%, 17%, 20%, 22% (TL1-5)] and increasing fire damage taken by [10%, 20%, 27%, 34%, 40% (TL1-5)].

Venomous - Fire a shot that deals [94%, 113%, 127%, 139%, 150% (TL1-5)] weapon damage as nature and explodes into a radius [1, 1, 2, 2, 2 (TL1-5)] cloud of crippling poison for [3, 4, 4, 5, 5 (TL1-5)] turns, dealing [59, 79, 95, 108, 120 (TL1-5; PP 100)] nature damage each turn and giving affected targets a [10%, 18%, 24%, 30%, 35% (TL1-5)] chance to fail talent usage.

Piercing - Fire a shot that explodes into a radius [1, 1, 2, 2, 2 (TL1-5)] burst of shredding shrapnel, dealing [94%, 113%, 127%, 139%, 150% (TL1-5)] weapon damage as physical and removing [0, 1, 1, 2, 2 (TL1-5)] beneficial physical effects or sustains.

The poison damage dealt increases with your Physical Power, and status chance increases with your Accuracy.
